## 🚀 Quickstart Guide

### 1. View the Live Web Dashboard
The web dashboard is accessible locally or in production:
* Local: `http://127.0.0.1:8000/`
* Production: `https://pulse-mexico.com/`

To launch or restart the dashboard locally at any time:
```powershell
START_LOCAL_WEBSITE.bat
# or
python run.py --web
```

### 2. Run the Autonomous Agent Swarm via CLI
To trigger an immediate data gathering and synthesis cycle across all agents:
```powershell
python run.py --all
```
Or run specific modular agents:
```powershell
python run.py --reddit      # Scrapes target subreddits
python run.py --twitter     # Scrapes Twitter complaints & official handles
python run.py --facebook    # Scrapes Vecinos and Bazar groups
python run.py --whatsapp    # Ingests sample WhatsApp neighbor chat
python run.py --report      # Synthesizes Daily Executive Briefing
python run.py --export      # Exports SQLite database to CSV and JSON
```

